  Role: 0
  RoleLabel: Fish
  Title: How to survive the hotel
  Summary: 'A / D or arrows: walk. Shift: run. Space: jump. Gamepad: left stick,
    stick click, A. Mouse aims the spotlight. Avoid carts and falling chandeliers;
    reach the stairwell and press E / X to challenge the ghost. Moving or active
    trap contact raises spook; at 100 you become ghost and the old ghost takes your
    body. Fish wins at 3 goals; ghost at 1. Others spectate. Choose Ready, wait for
    everyone, then the 10-second ghost setup before moving. Hallway return includes
    another ghost head start.'
  Instructions:
  - Heading: Move and jump
    Body: 'A / D or arrows walks; Shift runs; Space jumps from the ground. Gamepad:
      left stick, stick click to run, A to jump.'
  - Heading: See and avoid traps
    Body: Mouse aims the spotlight. Watch the floor and ceiling, run and jump past
      moving carts and falling chandeliers.
  - Heading: Spook and role swap
    Body: Contact from moving or active traps raises spook. At 100 you become ghost
      and the old ghost takes your fish body.
  - Heading: Stairwell challenge
    Body: Reach the stairwell door and press E / gamepad X. Click and drag your striker
      across both axes of your own half to hit the cue ball. Drag sideline defenses
      onto your half; they bounce the ball and break after 1-3 hits.
  - Heading: Win and return
    Body: Fish wins at 3 goals; ghost wins at 1. Other participants spectate. The
      hallway return includes another ghost head start.
  - Heading: Round start
    Body: Read the role page and deliberately choose Ready. Everyone must be ready;
      wait through the 10-second ghost setup before moving.
